# Jobs for Humanists

**Authors:** Solomon, Lewis C., And Others

## Abstract
To determine the increasing impact of the academic job shortage on humanities doctoral students, the Higher Education Research Institute (HERI) surveyed current humanities students and older graduates. Implications are addressed and a recommendation is made--that humanities students be made aware of the variety of programs and options available to them. (LBH)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ181860

